    "allowed_macro_suffixes_comment": "A macro ending in one of these suffixes is exempt from the allowlist in both passes. _IMPLEMENTATION is the canonical one-shot consumption idiom of every single-header vendor (stb_*, cgltf, miniaudio, clay, VMA, ...): our shim files define it exactly once and never use it, so naming it here per vendor would be ceremony, and a future vendored header must not require touching this file. First-party macros never take this shape.",
